<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isOutputOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between something that is created or produced and the activity that created or produced it."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasCurriculumVitae> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/usesEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an activity such as an expedition, a research project or an investigation, and an item of equipment employed in that activity."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasDecisionDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The date on which a particular action is or will be decided upon, or when an application, such as a grant application, is or will be approved or rejected."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasRegistrationDeadline> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://purl.org/spar/pro/withRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an agent's role in time to a definition of the type of role held by this agent."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/supports> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an agent and something that the agent supports by financial or other means."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isFundedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is funded by"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/ServiceContractFee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A fee paid periodically, typically annually, to obtain access when required to a service such as an equipment maintenance contract.\""@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/full-economic-costs> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Quotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "quotation"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/ComputationalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A computer system or software program whose action has an effect on external events, for example a laboratory robot that undertakes your experiments, or the financial control system that controls an institution's payrole, or that, following programmed business rules, prevents the principal investigator from placing an order for research equipment because there is insufficient money left in the project budget."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/ServiceContractFee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
