<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/FundingAgency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An organization that provides funding for projects or resources, often in the form of grants awarded on the basis of competitive application."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Purchase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The payment for obtaining something, for example property, goods or services."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasSerialNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has serial number"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Output> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Expenditure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Money going out of an account, because of expenditure on various entities."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/usesFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
